# Copy to .env.local for local development.
# Base URL of the C# API (arlink28-api repo; `dotnet run` http profile).
# Server-only: the browser calls this app's /api/v1 proxy, never the API directly.
API_URL=http://localhost:5270
# On Vercel set API_URL to the Render API URL for Production (and Preview). It is also read at build time,
# so it is declared in turbo.json; add any new build-time variable there too. See docs/staging.md.

# Stock photos (Unsplash) for packages that have none, while there is no real photography.
# On by default in `next dev`. Set to "true" to get them in a production build too. See utils/testPhotos.ts.
# TEST_PHOTOS=true
